2mfvhfDCd1jJNju5G155hX.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4185840707964602,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":31493,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of D.C.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uXkmzijKgBYAkeXas453ZrQxnNg.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4176470588235294,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":59556,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of Vancouver\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uVa6mO1m3DRgFa9fE4K9KtqUeaP.jpg\",\"rating\":3.9,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4161290322580645,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":217065,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of Cape Town\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mmtErozdP0z0hdNjcMvek8hNaKE.jpg\",\"rating\":3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41285714285714287,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":275387,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of London\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/38prd9zV2sH6SXp3E8qNZ4LT0g9.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4118421052631579,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":282461,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives van het Zuiden\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vtARZBbYpRBOQHpS4kb2Qidg0jz.jpg\",\"rating\":2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4116883116883117,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":110381,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of Salt Lake City\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/57DhzlJaKkkx2RlbH7Epb8P8YFJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4115384615384616,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":10,\"seasonName\":\"Season 10\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ylnXD1U9WgayLiVfEZhaLxItE2Y.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2019-11-06\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Sex, Lies and Video Debates\",\"overview\":\"Teresa awaits Joe's release from prison and transfer to an immigration detention facility as rumors swirl that she is having an affair; Jennifer posts a nasty video about Jackie on Instagram; Jackie says she believes the cheating rumors about Teresa.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ibQlyJgcXH565NE4qqqgcrcH5Mr.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-06\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"On Lock Down\",\"overview\":\"The Giudice Family struggles as Joe is released from prison but transferred to ICE. Dolores plans a fun event to get Teresa’s mind off her troubles, but when Teresa invites Danielle, the day turns to high drama.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5wocQYCTCa3uyo0kRRLFMkka73U.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-13\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"40 and Fancy Free\",\"overview\":\"Melissa turns 40 but worries that fights brewing between Jennifer and Jackie, Jackie and Teresa, and Margaret and Teresa could ruin the celebration; Margaret's mother decides to take a job in the city; Dolores tries to move her relationship forward.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ejX7qJ91ZGm9I6YpuEZIvXra51u.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-20\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Jamaican Jailbait\",\"overview\":\"As the ladies head to Jamaica for Jennifer’s birthday, Dolores reveals her dislike for Jackie and tensions mount between Teresa and Jackie. Margaret deals with the repercussions from her lawsuit with Vineyard Vines and the wrath of Teresa after she makes a joke about her alleged affair.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yZDgEo8uZhCAHjZrk1sYsETtGTZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-27\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Cut From a Different Cloth\",\"overview\":\"The feud between Jackie and Dolores reaches a fever pitch and Teresa confronts Margaret for making jokes about the cheating rumors. As the decision on Joe’s appeal approaches, the ladies begin to speculate on his chances of winning. And the men engage in a raunchy game of poker.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3HiHEgcEVNz8hzVtE9XnhrFjqfJ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-04\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Bay Breezes and Bad News\",\"overview\":\"Frank tries to get to the bottom of David’s intentions towards Dolores. Teresa reveals a surprising secret about Danielle and Marty. Finally, Joe Giudice gets a decision on his immigration appeal. On the other hand, Jennifer roasts the ladies as part of her birthday celebration.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rmtFS1MonLEhO8y56VnPWOury1g.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-11\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Last Supper\",\"overview\":\"The Jersey ladies prepare for Easter as Teresa’s family deals with Joe losing his appeal. Jennifer’s daughter discovers a surprising secret about her family and Jackie faces new challenges with her eating disorder.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xPPFjpujrnlicp2LRS3eAqenLLP.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-18\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Hair Today, Gone Tomorrow\",\"overview\":\"Margaret tries to do damage control against her Vineyard Vines Lawsuit. Jennifer’s daughter tries to convince her grandmother to accept that her uncle is gay. Meanwhile, Melissa and Joe share their baby news with their kids, and when Teresa invites all the ladies to a shopping event, Margaret and Danielle’s feud reaches new heights.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k4pI4hfFGqCQFbwLoTv4DzBeiYi.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-01\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Abs & Jabs\",\"overview\":\"As Melissa prepares for her Envy fashion show, Teresa continues siding with Danielle over Margaret; Joe Gorga becomes increasingly concerned about Teresa's mental state; Jackie discusses her eating issues with her kids.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4uP7mJp0CjwE64lfkWF14po1bQF.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-08\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Mama Drama\",\"overview\":\"Margaret hosts a Mother's Day drag brunch, but spars with her mother; Jackie plans a trip to the Hamptons hoping for a reconciliation between Margaret and Teresa; Jennifer tries to convince her mother to accept her brother's sexuality.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k8GyA1wFBIPbmyxBWyMjDRNwhKj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-15\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Clearing the Heir\",\"overview\":\"The ladies' quiet beach vacation goes crazy when Jennifer loses control. Jackie reveals a fascinating secret and Teresa tells the ladies the truth about her relationship with Joe Giudice.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vNOm3XtV3z2nW10jozxiqOcv2Mx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-22\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"The Hamptons Hangover\",\"overview\":\"Unable to make peace with Jackie and Melissa, Jennifer questions whether she should stay in the Hamptons; the Giudice family visits Joe in ICE; Margaret tries to make peace with her mother; Jackie comes to a realization about her eating disorder.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pCNNoHC1MZ3axILi9p52Z3uqCCa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-29\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Sorry Not Sorry\",\"overview\":\"Margaret hosts a 20th Anniversary party for Macbeth Collection. Meanwhile, Joe insults Bill about his sex life and Jackie has a heart to heart with her dad.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vlk4skof8hAqt1waRSQA2xPmiQH.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-05\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Something in the Water\",\"overview\":\"As the ladies head to the Jersey shore, Jennifer considers whether it’s worth apologizing to Melissa. Meanwhile, Frankie and Gia go to prom. Melissa plans to tell Danielle to keep away from the group and Jennifer and Margaret go head to head over their friendship with Teresa.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Al4A1WPyn2EdEBzBL1gMVVulDeM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-12\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Secrets Revealed\",\"overview\":\"Jennifer and Margaret continue their feud while Melissa confronts Danielle, whose secret threatens to break up the entire friend group.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aNTp4Sh2ZVZuX8ZczS5UxSfcKsM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-19\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Family Reunion\",\"overview\":\"Margaret and Teresa's friendship faces the ultimate test. Shockingly, Joe Giudice leaves ICE for Italy and Teresa and the girls arrive to see Joe. Teresa and Joe decide the future of their relationship.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jsROSqARg3vzzvrKtWCbxHbVhEz.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-26\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Reunion Part 1\",\"overview\":\"The reunion kicks off with Melissa, Margaret, Jackie, and Dolores sparring with Jennifer; Teresa remains loyal to her friend; Jackie reveals surprising details about her eating disorder; Dolores comes to a shocking conclusion about her relationship.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fmpWVnySwQ2Cjo3XXbJDpnTkpb0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-04\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Reunion Part 2\",\"overview\":\"Jackie and Jennifer's feud reaches new heights; Melissa questions the health of Teresa's marriage; the husbands shake up the set with shocking and hilarious details about all the women's sex lives; backstage, Danielle makes a surprising demand.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6AAOEq0irwdfsFqMvVEdqFTcSfg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-11\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Reunion Part 3\",\"overview\":\"Joe Gorga reveals what he really knew about the Joe Giudice cheating allegations; after shocking revelations, Margaret and Teresa's friendship is left hanging in the balance; Danielle attempts to shut down the reunion filming.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iB9t7VPzy8us52zSARKG5DpctiZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-18\",\"runtime\":43}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2009-05-12\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}